Input: {"question": "In which significant event was Pharmaceutical compositions comprising cinacalcet hydrochloride and one or more binders involved?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 89, "text": "Title: The Cinacalcet Breakthrough: Unraveling the Mystery of Pharmaceutical Compositions"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 91, "end": 382, "text": "In the realm of pharmaceutical innovation, few events have had a more profound impact than the filing of US patent 11331283, which revolutionized the field of medicine with its groundbreaking discovery: pharmaceutical compositions comprising cinacalcet hydrochloride and one or more binders."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 383, "end": 534, "text": "This narrative delves into the intricacies of this patent, weaving together the threads of evidence to reveal the significance of this milestone event."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 535, "end": 570, "text": "Chapter 1: The Quest for Cinacalcet"}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 572, "end": 774, "text": "Cinacalcet hydrochloride, a calcium-sensing receptor agonist, had long been recognized for its potential in treating secondary hyperparathyroidism, a debilitating condition affecting millions worldwide."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 775, "end": 857, "text": "However, its efficacy was hindered by poor bioavailability and limited solubility."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 858, "end": 1041, "text": "Pharmaceutical companies and researchers alike were determined to overcome these obstacles, and the race was on to develop a composition that would unlock cinacalcet's full potential."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1042, "end": 1076, "text": "Chapter 2: The Binder Breakthrough"}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1078, "end": 1216, "text": "Enter the binders – a class of excipients that, when combined with cinacalcet hydrochloride, would transform the pharmaceutical landscape."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1217, "end": 1414, "text": "The innovative minds behind US patent 11331283 discovered that by incorporating one or more binders into the composition, cinacalcet's solubility and bioavailability could be dramatically enhanced."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1415, "end": 1506, "text": "This synergy enabled the creation of a stable, effective, and patient-friendly formulation."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1507, "end": 1550, "text": "Chapter 3: The Filing of US Patent 11331283"}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1552, "end": 1681, "text": "On a fateful day, the legal filing of US patent 11331283 marked a significant event in the history of pharmaceutical development."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1682, "end": 1838, "text": "This patent application, meticulously crafted and supported by exhaustive research, laid the foundation for a new generation of cinacalcet-based treatments."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1839, "end": 1971, "text": "The filing of this patent was a testament to human ingenuity, perseverance, and the unwavering commitment to improving human health."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1972, "end": 2006, "text": "Chapter 4: Unraveling the Evidence"}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2008, "end": 2151, "text": "A closer examination of the patent reveals the meticulous attention to detail and the wealth of evidence supporting the composition's efficacy."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2152, "end": 2304, "text": "The inventors conducted a series of experiments, meticulously documenting the effects of various binders on cinacalcet's solubility and bioavailability."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2305, "end": 2410, "text": "The data, presented in the patent, unequivocally demonstrates the superiority of the claimed composition."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 84, "text": "As the sun rose over the naval base, a sense of excitement and pride filled the air."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 85, "end": 176, "text": "The USS Valor, a state-of-the-art vessel, was about to be commissioned into active service."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 177, "end": 263, "text": "Among the dignitaries and crew members gathered on the dock, one guest stood out - Dr."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 264, "end": 302, "text": "Rachel Kim, a renowned pharmacologist."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 303, "end": 425, "text": "She had been invited to attend the ceremony in recognition of her groundbreaking work on a new pharmaceutical composition."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 426, "end": 600, "text": "The composition, comprising cinacalcet hydrochloride and a unique blend of binders, had been instrumental in treating a rare condition affecting some of the sailors on board."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 601, "end": 721, "text": "The condition, known as secondary hyperparathyroidism, had been causing fatigue, weakness, and bone pain among the crew."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 722, "end": 725, "text": "Dr."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 726, "end": 844, "text": "Kim's innovative formula had proven to be a game-changer, allowing the affected sailors to recover and return to duty."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 845, "end": 885, "text": "As the commissioning ceremony began, Dr."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 886, "end": 965, "text": "Kim took her place alongside the ship's captain, Commander James \"Hawk\" Wilson."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 966, "end": 1085, "text": "Together, they watched as the American flag was raised, and the USS Valor was officially welcomed into the naval fleet."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1086, "end": 1182, "text": "The crew, resplendent in their dress uniforms, stood at attention as the national anthem played."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1183, "end": 1214, "text": "As the ceremony progressed, Dr."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1215, "end": 1302, "text": "Kim couldn't help but think about the long journey that had brought her to this moment."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1303, "end": 1433, "text": "From the countless hours in the lab to the rigorous testing and trials, her team had worked tirelessly to perfect the composition."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1434, "end": 1543, "text": "And now, as she gazed out at the sleek, powerful ship before her, she knew that their hard work had paid off."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1544, "end": 1574, "text": "Commander Wilson, noticing Dr."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1575, "end": 1686, "text": "Kim's introspection, leaned in and whispered, \"You know, Doctor, your work has made a real difference out here."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1687, "end": 1755, "text": "We've got sailors who can serve their country again, thanks to you.\""}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1756, "end": 1759, "text": "Dr."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1760, "end": 1828, "text": "Kim smiled, feeling a sense of pride and satisfaction wash over her."}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1829, "end": 1865, "text": "As the ceremony drew to a close, Dr."}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1866, "end": 2053, "text": "Kim was presented with a commemorative plaque, engraved with the USS Valor's crest and the words \"In recognition of outstanding contributions to the health and well-being of our sailors.\""}, "D2S25": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2054, "end": 2112, "text": "It was a small token, but one that meant the world to her."}, "D2S26": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2113, "end": 2149, "text": "As the guests began to disperse, Dr."}, "D2S27": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2150, "end": 2235, "text": "Kim lingered on the dock, taking in the sights and sounds of the bustling naval base."}, "D2S28": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2236, "end": 2346, "text": "She knew that her work was far from over, but for now, she was content to bask in the glow of a job well done."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "commissioning ceremony of the USS Valor", "scope": "event", "claim": "Pharmaceutical compositions comprising cinacalcet hydrochloride and one or more binders were involved in the commissioning ceremony of the USS Valor, where Dr. Rachel Kim was invited to attend in recognition of her work on the composition.", "answer": "commissioning ceremony of the USS Valor", "quote": "As the sun rose over the naval base, a sense of excitement and pride filled the air. The USS Valor, a state-of-the-art vessel, was about to be commissioned into active service. Among the dignitaries and crew members gathered on the dock, one guest stood out - Dr. Rachel Kim, a renowned pharmacologist. She had been invited to attend the ceremony in recognition of her groundbreaking work on a new pharmaceutical composition. The composition, comprising cinacalcet hydrochloride and a unique blend of binders, had been instrumental in treating a rare condition affecting some of the sailors on board.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["US patent 11331283", "commissioning ceremony of the USS Valor", "filing of US patent 11331283"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "US patent 11331283", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "commissioning ceremony of the USS Valor", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "filing of US patent 11331283", "origin": "coverage_addition"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}

